  "description": "The Double See Saw is cross-shaped, with four Knight Blue seats on two beams that meet at a central pivot. Two pairs of children can rock at the same time, each pair facing the other across the cross. It suits the 3 to 9 years Key User Group and carries four. The cross layout takes up 8'2\" x 6'9\" and needs a safe play area of 12'2\" x 10'9\". Because it is more square than long, it fits a corner of a garden where a straight four-seat see saw would not. The galvanised frame and roto-moulded seats come with a 3-year warranty, and bearings with 1 year. Ask us to plan it into your layout.",
